1
00:00:00,427 --> 00:00:02,840
A zombie ran toward my farmhouse.

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:04,257
Not to attack me.

3
00:00:04,310 --> 00:00:05,240
To hide.

4
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:09,387
Behind it, the cornfield was bending in a straight line.

5
00:00:09,903 --> 00:00:11,447
But the trees weren't moving.

6
00:00:12,917 --> 00:00:15,640
Then a glass on my table started shaking.

7
00:00:16,757 --> 00:00:22,033
Here's what we know: vibrations can travel through soil and into nearby buildings.

8
00:00:22,570 --> 00:00:25,373
But shaking alone can't tell you the cause.

9
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:27,513
I checked the tractor.

10
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:29,127
Engine off.

11
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:33,213
Outside, the fence posts rattled one after another.

12
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:36,613
Whatever was moving, it was heading toward the barn.

13
00:00:37,783 --> 00:00:39,007
Then I saw it.

14
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:41,040
The old maintenance hatch.

15
00:00:41,603 --> 00:00:43,953
Its rusted handle began turning.

16
00:00:44,603 --> 00:00:46,147
From underneath.

17
00:00:48,997 --> 00:00:52,140
My radio crackled for the first time all morning.

18
00:00:52,603 --> 00:00:54,147
A voice whispered...

19
00:00:55,153 --> 00:00:56,390
(radio, whispering) Don't let it out.

